        <Replace Tag="LOC_AWASE_REMOVEIT_CONFIRM_CAPITAL_CITY" Language="en_US">
            <Text>WARNING: You are destroying an original Capital City![NEWLINE]This will prevent all leaders from achieving a Domination Victory.[NEWLINE]All Wonders, Districts, Buildings, Population, and territory in the city will be lost. Completed Wonders cannot be rebuilt.</Text>
        </Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_AWASE_REMOVEIT_CONFIRM_CAPITAL_CITY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
            <Text>警告：您正在摧毁原始首都城市！[NEWLINE]这会导致所有领袖均无法达成统治胜利。[NEWLINE]城市中所有奇观、区域、建筑、人口和领土都将消失。已完成的奇观将无法重建。</Text>
        </Replace>
